### Phase 16: Trust & Safety HTTP Test Pack
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Signup (creates unverified account + dispatches 24h verification email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ravi Kumar",
  "username": "ravikumar_ts16",
  "email": "ravi.kumar+teamforge@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Project Owner"
}

### 2. Verify Email (24h single-use token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL"
}

### 3. Resend Verification Email (2-minute cooldown -> 429 RESEND_COOLDOWN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 4. Create Project (5+ char title, 100+ char description, content filter, 3/day & 10 open caps)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Class Assistant Analytics",
  "description": "An open-source academic project workspace built with React, Python, and NestJS for collaborating on assignments.",
  "requiredSkills": ["React", "Python"],
  "dueDate": "2027-06-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "maxCollaborators": 4
}

### 5. Report a Chat Message (saves 20-message snapshot; 10/day -> 429 TOO_MANY_REPORTS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/communication/messages/msg-1/report
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "This chat message contains abusive harassment toward collaborators."
}

### 6. Admin: List Possible Duplicate Accounts (requires admin 'users' permission or superuser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/duplicates
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN

### 7. Phone OTP Challenge Status / Request / Verify (5 wrong attempts -> 15m OTP_LOCKED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/phone/otp-status
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/phone/request-otp
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+919876543210"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/phone/verify-otp
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "code": "123456"
}
